Modus Themes Ports provenance
==============================

The palette data is based on the Modus themes designed by Protesilaos Stavrou
and published under CC0-1.0 at:
https://protesilaos.com/emacs/modus-themes-colors

The current vendored source is Modus Themes 5.3.0 at upstream commit
52d4665bc5d5505e9761fe6068ab5426ad70a52a. Palette data is extracted without
upstream presets, then the project-owned render profile in
mappings/palette/default.json is applied to the generated ports.

